  abilityId: 820758
  abilityName: Volatile Variable
  abilityDesc: 27 combo powerful Water attack on all foes, adds low probability of
    resistance against 1 KO attack, damage taken hugely boosts BB gauge and may restore
    HP for 3 turns, adds probable 2 turn Atk, Def reduction counter for 3 turns &
    reduces active healing for 2 turns (PvP modes only)
